    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NEITJE: “Do nothing.”\nSALOME: “Stay and fight.”\nSALOME/NEITJE: “Leave.”",
      "AGATA: But Greta, we are not animals.\nGRETA: We have been preyed upon like animals. Maybe we should respond like animals.\nONA: Do you mean run away?\nSALOME: Or kill our attackers?",
      "MARICHE: Write it down. Under pros. Salome has had a brilliant idea.\nMARICHE: “If we stay, we won’t have to leave.”\nNEITJE: We won’t have to pack.\nMEJAL: We won’t have to figure out where we’re going or experience the uncertainty of not knowing where we are going. We don’t have a map.",
      "ONA: But if, in all your life, you truly felt that it didn’t matter what you thought, how would that make you feel?\nONA: When we have liberated ourselves, we will have to ask ourselves who we are.\nSALOME: Will we be done by suppertime? I have to give little Miep her antibiotics.\nGRETA: Where did you get antibiotics?",
      "AUTJE: But-\nMEJAL: But what?\nAUTJE: She doesn’t speak anymore.\nMEJAL: She speaks to the children. I think they call her Melvin."
    ]
  },
